{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Requiring all businesses with public toilets to have baby changing facilities",
        "additional_details": "We are calling for a basic standard that if a venue provides customer toilets, parents and carers should be able to safely and hygienically change their baby there.\r\n\r\nParents should not be forced to change their baby on a toilet floor, in a pram, on a chair or in another unsuitable public space simply because the venue has chosen not to provide a changing facility.",
        "background": "Parents and carers shouldn\u2019t be forced to change their child on dirty floors or anywhere with no privacy. I am asking for a law that requires all businesses and venues that provide toilet facilities for their customers should also provide suitable baby-changing facilities.",
